# Performance Rules

- Minimize client JS bundle.
- Avoid over-fetching data.
- Avoid large serialized props.
- Prevent unnecessary re-renders.
- Use memoization (`useMemo`/`useCallback`) for non-trivial derived data.
- Avoid expensive operations in components.
- Evaluate Suspense boundaries.
- Optimize dynamic imports.
- Log any performance drift to memorybank with suggested tasks.
